# Complexity
- Time complexity: O(N)

- Space complexity: O(1)

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int removeElement(int[] nums, int val) {
        int k = 0;
        for (int num : nums) {
            if (num != val)
                nums[k++] = num;
        }

        return k;
    }
}
```
```C++ []
class Solution {
public:
    int removeElement(vector<int>& nums, int val) {
        int k = 0;
        for(int i=0;i<nums.size();i++) {
            if(nums[i] != val)
                nums[k++] = nums[i];
        }

        return k;
    }
};
```
